What is the difference between a vegetarian pizza and a vegan pizza?

SPARQL query: PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX pizza: <http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/pizza.owl#>

SELECT ?pizza WHERE {
  ?pizza owl:equivalentClass [
    owl:intersectionOf (
      [ owl:onProperty pizza:hasTopping ;
        owl:someValuesFrom pizza:VegetarianTopping
      ]
    )
  ] .
}

